                            <p class="text-gray-500">
                                                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Ali Naail was appointed as a Non-Executive Independent Director of the Board on 24th December 2023. Mr. Naail is an entrepreneur and has over a decade of experience in the private business sector.&nbsp;
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Naail is a director of one of the most prominent private companies, Redwave Private Limited in the Maldives. He is also a director at Redwave Construction and Avalon Private Limited. Under the stewardship of Mr. Naail, the business has seen considerable growth with numerous mega outlets in the Greater Male Region.&nbsp;
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Naail holds a Bachelor (Hons) of Computing from Segi University of Malaysia and Diploma from Sunway University, Malaysia&nbsp;
    </div>
</div>
                                                                                                        <div class="page-block paragraph-block mb-4">
    <div class="text-justify">
    Mr. Ali Naail does not own any shares in the company.&nbsp;
    </div>
</div>
